        "type": "TEXT_BOX (17)",
        "left": 5508850,
        "top": 2183275,
        "width": 3275100,
        "height": 1694400,
        "text": "70%–80% \n Remaining Usable Energy  \n Average storage capacity still available when an EV battery is retired from a car.  "
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "name": "Google Shape;162;p29",
