        "type": "AUTO_SHAPE (1)",
        "left": 628650,
        "top": 1355050,
        "width": 4622400,
        "height": 994200,
        "text": "Batteries Discarded Too Early \n EVs retire batteries when they reach 70–80% capacity, leaving plenty of energy unused."
      },
      {
        "index": 4,
        "name": "Google Shape;164;p29",
        "type": "AUTO_SHAPE (1)",
        "left": 596550,
        "top": 2583550,
        "width": 4686600,
        "height": 1081200,
        "text": "Manual Testing is Too Slow \n Standard laboratory testing takes days of slow charging and discharging for each pack."
      },
      {
        "index": 5,
        "name": "Google Shape;165;p29",
        "type": "AUTO_SHAPE (1)",
        "left": 628900,
        "top": 3817075,
        "width": 4686600,
        "height": 994200,
        "text": "No Automated Sorting \n Without quick digital grading, working batteries are prematurely sent to recycling."
      }
    ]
  },
